-- int-tests-work-and-sanction.l4: whole scenarios S05 to S08, S14, S15, S17 and S18 of expectations.md: who may do or engage whom for which work,
-- which violation that makes, and what the Third Schedule then prices, crossing groups 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 and 7.  Every expected value
-- was written in expectations.md from the Hebrew text before this module was run.  Amounts: the update day is 15.6.2030; the
-- first update year is 2026; the sanction readings give a ratio of 102/100 for 1.1.2026 and 1 for every later 1 January, so each
-- Third Schedule amount is the enacted amount times 1.02, rounded to NIS 10.

§ `Tests: work, engagement and sanction`

`the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` MEANS `fixture: the pricing of a violation that did not continue and has no earlier violation, updated on` (YMD 2030 6 15)
`the section 46 hypothesis` MEANS `fixture: the commencement facts with a hypothetical regulation under section 46`

`R134a, 10 kW` MEANS `fixture: a system of` 10 `kilowatts using refrigerant` "134a"
`R134a, 25 kW` MEANS `fixture: a system of` 25 `kilowatts using refrigerant` "134a"
`R134a, 5 kW` MEANS `fixture: a system of` 5 `kilowatts using refrigerant` "134a"

`Noa: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 February 2029` MEANS `fixture: an ordinary licence held by` `fixture: Noa, an individual` `of kind` `grade 1 licence` `granted on` (YMD 2029 2 1)
`Noa: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 December 2025` MEANS `fixture: an ordinary licence held by` `fixture: Noa, an individual` `of kind` `grade 1 licence` `granted on` (YMD 2025 12 1)
`Noa: a grade 2 licence granted on 1 February 2029` MEANS `fixture: an ordinary licence held by` `fixture: Noa, an individual` `of kind` `grade 2 licence` `granted on` (YMD 2029 2 1)
`Dana: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 February 2029` MEANS `fixture: an ordinary licence held by` `fixture: Dana, an individual` `of kind` `grade 1 licence` `granted on` (YMD 2029 2 1)

§§ `S05. The operator and the engaged person (groups 3, 1, 2, 7, 6)`

-- Validity of Noa's licence of 1.2.2029: five years end 1.2.2034, earlier than 31.3.2034.
#ASSERT `s 8 — the last day of validity of the licence` `Noa: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 February 2029` EQUALS YMD 2034 2 1

-- A grade 1 licence in force, a 25 kW system: grade 1 covers up to 18 kW only, so the kinds appropriate to A.1(2) on 25 kW are grades 2 and 3 (First Schedule rows 2 and 3; s.2).
`Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for A.1(2) on 25 kW` MEANS `fixture: the engagement by` `fixture: Ofek Ltd, a corporation` `of a person holding` (LIST `Noa: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 February 2029`) `on` (YMD 2030 4 1) `for work on the system` `R134a, 25 kW` `amounting to` `A.1(2) connecting piping and conductors to the units`
#ASSERT NOT elem `grade 1 licence` (`licence kinds appropriate to the activity on the system` `A.1(2) connecting piping and conductors to the units` `R134a, 25 kW`)
#ASSERT elem `grade 2 licence` (`licence kinds appropriate to the activity on the system` `A.1(2) connecting piping and conductors to the units` `R134a, 25 kW`)
#ASSERT elem `grade 3 licence` (`licence kinds appropriate to the activity on the system` `A.1(2) connecting piping and conductors to the units` `R134a, 25 kW`)
#ASSERT NOT `int — the operator may engage the person in` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for A.1(2) on 25 kW`
#ASSERT `int — the violation committed under section 18(a) in` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for A.1(2) on 25 kW` `with the reference` "ofek-2030-04-01" EQUALS JUST (Violation WITH `the violator` IS `fixture: Ofek Ltd, a corporation`, `the listed violation` IS `engaging a person without a licence of the appropriate kind`, `reference for the act` IS "ofek-2030-04-01", `date of the act` IS YMD 2030 4 1)
-- Item (6), corporation column: 20,000, times 102/100 = 20,400.
#ASSERT `int — the sanction for the engagement` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for A.1(2) on 25 kW` `with the reference` "ofek-2030-04-01" `priced from` `the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` `with the commencement` `the section 46 hypothesis` EQUALS `the sanction is` 20400

-- A licence of 1.12.2025 ended on 31.3.2030: none is in force on 1.4.2030, so item (5): corporation 40,000 times 1.02 = 40,800.
`Ofek engages Noa (lapsed) for A.1(2) on 25 kW` MEANS `fixture: the engagement by` `fixture: Ofek Ltd, a corporation` `of a person holding` (LIST `Noa: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 December 2025`) `on` (YMD 2030 4 1) `for work on the system` `R134a, 25 kW` `amounting to` `A.1(2) connecting piping and conductors to the units`
#ASSERT `int — the violation committed under section 18(a) in` `Ofek engages Noa (lapsed) for A.1(2) on 25 kW` `with the reference` "ofek-lapsed" EQUALS JUST (Violation WITH `the violator` IS `fixture: Ofek Ltd, a corporation`, `the listed violation` IS `engaging a person who had no licence at all`, `reference for the act` IS "ofek-lapsed", `date of the act` IS YMD 2030 4 1)
#ASSERT `int — the sanction for the engagement` `Ofek engages Noa (lapsed) for A.1(2) on 25 kW` `with the reference` "ofek-lapsed" `priced from` `the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` `with the commencement` `the section 46 hypothesis` EQUALS `the sanction is` 40800

-- A grade 2 licence in force: appropriate to 25 kW and listed for A.1(2): the operator may engage; no violation; nothing priced.
`Ofek engages Noa (grade 2, in force) for A.1(2) on 25 kW` MEANS `fixture: the engagement by` `fixture: Ofek Ltd, a corporation` `of a person holding` (LIST `Noa: a grade 2 licence granted on 1 February 2029`) `on` (YMD 2030 4 1) `for work on the system` `R134a, 25 kW` `amounting to` `A.1(2) connecting piping and conductors to the units`
#ASSERT `int — the operator may engage the person in` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 2, in force) for A.1(2) on 25 kW`
#ASSERT `int — the violation committed under section 18(a) in` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 2, in force) for A.1(2) on 25 kW` `with the reference` "ofek-ok" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `int — the sanction for the engagement` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 2, in force) for A.1(2) on 25 kW` `with the reference` "ofek-ok" `priced from` `the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` `with the commencement` `the section 46 hypothesis` EQUALS `no listed violation: the facts breach no provision that the Third Schedule prices`

§§ `S06. "Appropriate" means appropriate to the work (the lead's finding P1) (groups 1, 3, 2, 6, 7)`

-- Noa, a grade 1 licence in force on 1.4.2030, adds oil during maintenance (First Schedule B.3(3), listed under grade 3 only) on a 5 kW system.
`Noa: the oil work of maintenance on 5 kW` MEANS `fixture: the work of` `fixture: Noa, an individual` `holding` (LIST `Noa: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 February 2029`) `on` (YMD 2030 4 1) `on the system` `R134a, 5 kW` `amounting to` `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`
#ASSERT `int — the kinds in force for the situation` `Noa: the oil work of maintenance on 5 kW` EQUALS LIST `grade 1 licence`
#ASSERT `licence kinds appropriate to the activity on the system` `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance` `R134a, 5 kW` EQUALS LIST `grade 3 licence`
-- The worker holds a licence, but not one appropriate to this work: s.3(a) forbids it, Third Schedule item (2); individual 10,000 times 1.02 = 10,200.
#ASSERT `int — the outcome of section 3(a) for the work of` `Noa: the oil work of maintenance on 5 kW` EQUALS `the work is forbidden: the person holds no licence of the kind appropriate to the system and the work`
#ASSERT NOT `int — the person may do the work of` `Noa: the oil work of maintenance on 5 kW`
#ASSERT `int — the sanction for the work of` `Noa: the oil work of maintenance on 5 kW` `with the reference` "noa-oil" `priced from` `the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` `with the commencement` `the section 46 hypothesis` EQUALS `the sanction is` 10200
-- The operator who engages her for that work: the same word, the same meaning (default): not permitted, item (6), corporation 20,000 times 1.02 = 20,400.
`Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for oil in maintenance on 5 kW` MEANS `fixture: the engagement by` `fixture: Ofek Ltd, a corporation` `of a person holding` (LIST `Noa: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 February 2029`) `on` (YMD 2030 4 1) `for work on the system` `R134a, 5 kW` `amounting to` `B.3(3) adding or replacing oil during maintenance`
#ASSERT NOT `int — the operator may engage the person in` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for oil in maintenance on 5 kW`
#ASSERT `int — the violation committed under section 18(a) in` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for oil in maintenance on 5 kW` `with the reference` "ofek-oil" EQUALS JUST (Violation WITH `the violator` IS `fixture: Ofek Ltd, a corporation`, `the listed violation` IS `engaging a person without a licence of the appropriate kind`, `reference for the act` IS "ofek-oil", `date of the act` IS YMD 2030 4 1)
#ASSERT `int — the sanction for the engagement` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for oil in maintenance on 5 kW` `with the reference` "ofek-oil" `priced from` `the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` `with the commencement` `the section 46 hypothesis` EQUALS `the sanction is` 20400
-- The capacity-only reading (the PLAN's IP3): grade 1 covers 5 kW, so the operator may engage her and no violation arises.  It is the alternative, not the default.
#ASSERT `int (capacity only) — the operator may engage the person in` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for oil in maintenance on 5 kW`
#ASSERT `int (capacity only) — the violation committed under section 18(a) in` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for oil in maintenance on 5 kW` `with the reference` "ofek-oil" EQUALS NOTHING
-- The same oil added while INSTALLING (A.1(5)) is listed under grade 1: the worker may do it and the operator may engage her.
`Noa: the oil work of installation on 5 kW` MEANS `fixture: the work of` `fixture: Noa, an individual` `holding` (LIST `Noa: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 February 2029`) `on` (YMD 2030 4 1) `on the system` `R134a, 5 kW` `amounting to` `A.1(5) refrigerant and oil handling during installation`
#ASSERT `int — the person may do the work of` `Noa: the oil work of installation on 5 kW`
`Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for oil in installation on 5 kW` MEANS `fixture: the engagement by` `fixture: Ofek Ltd, a corporation` `of a person holding` (LIST `Noa: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 February 2029`) `on` (YMD 2030 4 1) `for work on the system` `R134a, 5 kW` `amounting to` `A.1(5) refrigerant and oil handling during installation`
#ASSERT `int — the operator may engage the person in` `Ofek engages Noa (grade 1, in force) for oil in installation on 5 kW`

§§ `S07. An installation without the tightness test (groups 3, 2, 7, 6)`

`the wording of 1 January 2020 with no tightness test` MEANS `Wording of Israeli Standard 994` WITH
    `the day this wording took effect` IS YMD 2020 1 1
    `the work conformed to part 4 of this wording` IS FALSE
    `a tightness test of the refrigerant piping was performed as the testing chapter of part 4 of this wording requires` IS FALSE
    `the work conformed to part 5 of this wording` IS TRUE
`Dana: the installation on 1 April 2030` MEANS `fixture: the work of` `fixture: Dana, an individual` `holding` (LIST `Dana: a grade 1 licence granted on 1 February 2029`) `on` (YMD 2030 4 1) `on the system` `R134a, 10 kW` `amounting to` `A.1(3) testing the refrigerant piping after installation`
-- Item (4): a licensee installed without the tightness test of the testing chapter of part 4: individual 20,000 times 1.02 = 20,400.
#ASSERT `int — the violation committed under section 13 by` `Dana: the installation on 1 April 2030` `being a` `an installation job` `with the reference` "dana-install" `judged by` (LIST `the wording of 1 January 2020 with no tightness test`) EQUALS JUST (Violation WITH `the violator` IS `fixture: Dana, an individual`, `the listed violation` IS `installation without the tightness test of the piping`, `reference for the act` IS "dana-install", `date of the act` IS YMD 2030 4 1)
#ASSERT `int — the sanction for` (`int — the violation committed under section 13 by` `Dana: the installation on 1 April 2030` `being a` `an installation job` `with the reference` "dana-install" `judged by` (LIST `the wording of 1 January 2020 with no tightness test`)) `priced from` `the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` `with the commencement` `the section 46 hypothesis` EQUALS `the sanction is` 20400
-- Kar-Kor Ltd (a corporation) holds a grade 3 licence and does the same: the corporation column of item (4) is a dash, so the Law gives no amount: a refusal.
`Kar-Kor: a grade 3 licence granted on 1 February 2029` MEANS `fixture: an ordinary licence held by` `fixture: Kar-Kor Ltd, a corporation` `of kind` `grade 3 licence` `granted on` (YMD 2029 2 1)
`Kar-Kor: the installation on 1 April 2030` MEANS `fixture: the work of` `fixture: Kar-Kor Ltd, a corporation` `holding` (LIST `Kar-Kor: a grade 3 licence granted on 1 February 2029`) `on` (YMD 2030 4 1) `on the system` `R134a, 10 kW` `amounting to` `A.1(3) testing the refrigerant piping after installation`
#ASSERT REFUSED `int — the sanction for` (`int — the violation committed under section 13 by` `Kar-Kor: the installation on 1 April 2030` `being a` `an installation job` `with the reference` "karkor-install" `judged by` (LIST `the wording of 1 January 2020 with no tightness test`)) `priced from` `the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` `with the commencement` `the section 46 hypothesis`
-- Maintenance without the test breaches s.13 but no item prices it: no listed violation.
#ASSERT `int — the violation committed under section 13 by` `Dana: the installation on 1 April 2030` `being a` `a maintenance job` `with the reference` "dana-maintenance" `judged by` (LIST `the wording of 1 January 2020 with no tightness test`) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `S08. A document an inspector demanded (groups 5, 6, 7)`

`an inspector who is fully equipped` MEANS `An inspector at work` OF TRUE, (LIST `require name, address and identification`, `require information or a document`, `enter a place to supervise`, `make measurements and tests`, `order measurements and tests kept`, `deal with measurements and tests otherwise`), TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`an inspector with no badge in sight` MEANS `An inspector at work` OF TRUE, (LIST `require name, address and identification`, `require information or a document`, `enter a place to supervise`, `make measurements and tests`, `order measurements and tests kept`, `deal with measurements and tests otherwise`), TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`a demand for a document` MEANS `Demand under section 31(2)` OF TRUE, `a document that is not computer output`, TRUE, TRUE
-- Item (7): not giving a document an inspector lawfully demanded under s.31(2).  Individual 3,000 times 1.02 = 3,060; corporation 6,000 times 1.02 = 6,120.
#ASSERT `int — the violation committed under section 31(2) by` `fixture: Dana, an individual` `with the reference` "dana-doc" `on the day` (YMD 2030 4 1) `when the inspector was` `an inspector who is fully equipped` `and the demand was` `a demand for a document` `and the person did not give the document is` TRUE EQUALS JUST (Violation WITH `the violator` IS `fixture: Dana, an individual`, `the listed violation` IS `failing to give a document an inspector demanded`, `reference for the act` IS "dana-doc", `date of the act` IS YMD 2030 4 1)
#ASSERT `int — the sanction for` (`int — the violation committed under section 31(2) by` `fixture: Dana, an individual` `with the reference` "dana-doc" `on the day` (YMD 2030 4 1) `when the inspector was` `an inspector who is fully equipped` `and the demand was` `a demand for a document` `and the person did not give the document is` TRUE) `priced from` `the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` `with the commencement` `the section 46 hypothesis` EQUALS `the sanction is` 3060
#ASSERT `int — the sanction for` (`int — the violation committed under section 31(2) by` `fixture: Kar-Kor Ltd, a corporation` `with the reference` "karkor-doc" `on the day` (YMD 2030 4 1) `when the inspector was` `an inspector who is fully equipped` `and the demand was` `a demand for a document` `and the person did not give the document is` TRUE) `priced from` `the pricing updated on 15 June 2030` `with the commencement` `the section 46 hypothesis` EQUALS `the sanction is` 6120
-- A person who gave the document: no violation.  An inspector with no badge: the demand is not lawful (s.32), so no violation.
#ASSERT `int — the violation committed under section 31(2) by` `fixture: Dana, an individual` `with the reference` "dana-doc-given" `on the day` (YMD 2030 4 1) `when the inspector was` `an inspector who is fully equipped` `and the demand was` `a demand for a document` `and the person did not give the document is` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `int — the violation committed under section 31(2) by` `fixture: Dana, an individual` `with the reference` "dana-doc-nobadge" `on the day` (YMD 2030 4 1) `when the inspector was` `an inspector with no badge in sight` `and the demand was` `a demand for a document` `and the person did not give the document is` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

