§§ `S15. The 70 kW edge (groups 1, 2, 3, 6)`

`a system of 70 kW` MEANS `fixture: a system of` 70 `kilowatts using refrigerant` "134a"
`a system of 70.01 kW` MEANS `fixture: a system of` 70.01 `kilowatts using refrigerant` "134a"
#ASSERT NOT elem `grade 1 licence` (`licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 70 kW`)
#ASSERT elem `grade 2 licence` (`licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 70 kW`)
#ASSERT NOT elem `grade 2 licence` (`licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 70.01 kW`)
#ASSERT elem `grade 3 licence` (`licence kinds that cover a cooling system` `a system of 70.01 kW`)
-- s.9(a)(1): a foreign expert invited for a system "over 70 kW": 70 is not over, 70.01 is.  Group 2 and group 1 draw the same line.
GIVEN kilowatts IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Facts of a grant of a temporary licence under section 9`
`an expert invited for a system with this capacity in kilowatts` kilowatts MEANS `Facts of a grant of a temporary licence under section 9` WITH
    `the expert` IS `Foreign expert's application under section 9` WITH
        `the application` IS `Application` WITH
            `the applicant` IS `fixture: an applicant with no prior training, being` `fixture: Hans, an individual and a foreign expert`
            `the kind of licence sought` IS `grade 3 licence`
            `an application to renew` IS FALSE
            `an application for a temporary licence` IS TRUE
            `the day of the application` IS YMD 2025 12 1
        `the applicant comes from a foreign state` IS TRUE
        `the system the expert was invited to work on` IS `fixture: a system of` kilowatts `kilowatts using refrigerant` "134a"
        `authorised to do such work in a foreign state` IS TRUE
        `work done abroad` IS LIST `Work done abroad by a foreign expert under section 9` WITH
            `the work` IS `Work item` WITH
                `performed by` IS `fixture: Hans, an individual and a foreign expert`
                `the kind of job` IS `an installation job`
                `the system` IS `fixture: a system of` kilowatts `kilowatts using refrigerant` "134a"
                `date performed` IS YMD 2022 9 1
            `on a system similar to the systems the expert was invited to work on` IS TRUE
    `in the Registrar's opinion the expert is of repute and a renowned expert in the field` IS TRUE
    `the vintage of the Fees Regulations` IS `the Fees Regulations as made`
    `the amount paid for the application` IS 398
    `the index readings` IS EMPTY
#ASSERT NOT `int — the Registrar may grant a temporary licence on` (`an expert invited for a system with this capacity in kilowatts` 70)
#ASSERT `int — the Registrar may grant a temporary licence on` (`an expert invited for a system with this capacity in kilowatts` 70.01)
